    "caption": "🌍 Win $100,000 at TechCrunch Startup Battlefield 2025 in San Francisco!\n\nApplications are open for TechCrunch Startup Battlefield 2025 — your chance to step onto the world’s most prestigious startup stage in San Francisco and represent Central Eurasia in the finals!\n\n💥 The top 3 startups from the region will have a unique opportunity to pitch in front of Silicon Valley investors and international media.\n\nWhy apply?\n✅ $100,000 equity-free prize\n✅ Startup booth at TechCrunch Disrupt (3 days)\n✅ Pitch on the Main Stage in front of top investors\n✅ Media coverage by TechCrunch.com\n✅ 2-week stay covered for 2 team members\n\nWho should apply?\n🔹 Early-stage tech startups\n🔹 Founded by entrepreneurs from Central Eurasia\n🔹 Scalable and investment-ready\n\n📅 Application deadline: July 15\n🔗 Link in profile bio, under «Programs»\n\n🚀 Join the Road to Battlefield — and pitch your startup on the TechCrunch stage!",
